              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjonjanga arakudūgiye: mera magabo ku ruzitiro rw’amabuye, shibama mu nzira, kenyera zigume, iyungunganye uk’ ushoboye kwose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.1+ISA.5.2+ISA.5.3+ISA.5.4+ISA.5.5+ISA.5.6+ISA.5.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 5:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ Uhoraho agarukanye icubahiro c’aba Yakobo, nk’icubahiro c’Abisirayeli; kukw abasahuzi babasahuye, bagahanyagura amashami y’imizabibu yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkinzo z’abahizi biwe ziratukura, intōre ziwe zambaye iz’ agahama: ivyuma vy’imikogote yiwe y’intambara birakayangana ku musi wo kwitegura kwiwe, amacumu arikw aranyugutwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imikogote y’intambara igenda akābushūngwe mu mayira, igenda iranyuranwa mu nzira z’ibihamo; uyibonye wogira ngo n’imuri, yidunya nk’umuravyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 46:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahamagara abahizi biwe, ariko bagenda baratsitara; bihutira kuja ku ruzitiro rwaho rw’amabuye, kandi bakitegura kwirwanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 14:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "45:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imigomero y’inzūzi iragomorowe, n’ingoro y’umwami irasenyeranye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.38.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 38:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwamikazi yambitswe ubusa, ajanywe ar’ inyagano; incoreke ziwe zicura intimba nk’ inuma, zikagenda zirīshishitira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 46:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninewe hameze nk’ikidengeri c’amazi gisenzwe: barasemerera, bati Hagarara, hagarara! ariko ntihagira ūhindukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni musahure amafeza, musahure n’amazahabu, kukw itunga ririho ritimirije gushira, bo n’isinzi ry’ ibintu vyose vy’imbombovu bihimbaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 13:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.13+ZEP.2.14+ZEP.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasigaye ubusa, barahogeje, bahasize ar’ umusaka; umutima wahavuyemwo, amavi arakomangana, ukwihebura kuhaciye umugongo, mu maso ha bose harajonjogoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 2:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urwobo rw’intambge rwabaye iki, n’irīro ry’imigunza, ah’ intambge n’ingore yayo n’ivyana vyazo vyatahukira, ata co vyicura? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ereg’ intambge yahora itabagura ivyo guhimvya ivyana vyayo, ikanigira ingore zayo, ikuzuza amasenga yayo ivyo yishe, n’ivyobo vyayo ivyo yasahuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
